                <td class='text-center'><span class='badge-success'>✓ Exists</span></td>
                <td class='text-center'><span class='badge-warning'>Pending</span></td>
            </tr></tbody></table><div class='section-title'>4. Credit Covenant Evaluation Framework</div><div style='font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:5px; color:#555;'>A. Quantitative Financial Metrics (Account Ref: 102015)</div><table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th width='25%'>Covenant Classification</th>
                <th width='40%'>Target Directive Specification</th>
                <th width='15%'>Baseline Target</th>
                <th width='20%'>Observed Metrics</th>
            </tr>
        </thead><tbody><tr>
                <td class='fw-bold'>Minimum DSCR</td>
                <td>The Borrower shall maintain a DSCR of not less than 1.20x at all times
 DSCR = EBITDA ÷ (Interest + Principal Due)</td>
