                <td class='text-center fw-bold badge-danger'>54000</td>
            </tr></tbody></table><div style='font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:5px; color:#555;'>B. Qualitative Operational Covenants</div><table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th width='25%'>Requirement Category</th>
                <th width='45%'>Covenant Obligation / Directive Details</th>
                <th width='30%'>Compliance Verification / Remarks</th>
            </tr>
        </thead><tbody><tr>
                <td class='fw-bold'>Asset Integrity</td>
                <td>Borrower shall maintain: Valid class certificates Insurance (H&M, P&I, WIBA, third-party liability)  - Maintenance logs  - Lender may request periodic inspection reports.</td>
